  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Strengthening Digitalization of Government Functions of the Republic of Tajikistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy frameworks and roadmaps for the introduction of national e-government based on national policies such as national development ;concept paper 2020-2040;Pilot service for test bed area (system);Database for testbed areas (for autonomous districts under government jurisdiction, including Dushanbe City);Plan to create an infrastructure environment for e-government support;A plan to strengthen the capacity of digital government utilization</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To transform from a traditional agricultural economy to an IT-based digital economy, based on efforts to transition to a digital government&#xACF5;&#xACF5;&#xB370;&#xC774;&#xD130; &#xAC70;&#xBC84;&#xB10C;&#xC2A4; &#xAE30;&#xD68D; &#xBC0F; &#xC6B4;&#xC601;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xBC94;&#xC815;&#xBD80; &#xC815;&#xBCF4;&#xD654; &#xAD00;&#xB9AC;&#xCCB4;&#xACC4; &#xC218;&#xB9BD;									
